 "description": "<p>A one-piece knit sweater with a fully open back, in white, gray, or black, one size for 85-130 lbs. The single-garment approach means the costume is the sweater, full stop - pull it on and the look is decided.</p>\n<p>Three colorways split the effect: white reads softest, black reads sharpest, gray sits between. The knit is polyester and machine-tractable, unlike wool costume knits.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester knit</li>\n<li>Item type: sweater</li>\n<li>Features: backless</li>\n<li>Color: white, gray, or black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, 85-130 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 85-130 lbs. The simplest cold-month costume on the site - one piece, three colors, zero decisions beyond that.</p>\n",
